  {
   "id": "b10-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 703,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: Y’s own shortest path to E doesn’t end with S–E",
   "originalText": "The rule: Y’s own shortest path to E doesn’t end with S–E",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 508,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y ∈ Q(E)   ⇔   dist(Y,E)  <  dist(Y,S) + c(S,E)",
   "originalText": "Y ∈ Q(E)   ⇔   dist(Y,E)  <  dist(Y,S) + c(S,E)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 933,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The right side is Y’s cheapest path to E that ends with the link S–E: Y → … → S, then S → E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ no shortest path from Y to E crosses S–E, so a packet dropped at Y reaches E\n   safely. E then forwards it to D.\n•  Note the direction: dist(Y,E) is from Y towards E. With per-direction metrics it comes from a\n   reverse SPF rooted at E (A1, §1.2).",
   "originalText": "•  The right side is Y’s cheapest path to E that ends with the link S–E: Y → … → S, then S → E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ no shortest path from Y to E crosses S–E, so a packet dropped at Y reaches E\n   safely. E then forwards it to D.\n•  Note the direction: dist(Y,E) is from Y towards E. With per-direction metrics it comes from a\n   reverse SPF rooted at E (A1, §1.2).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 447,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks, Example 4 (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks, Example 4 (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 693,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y     dist(Y,P1)   dist(Y,PE1) + c(PE1,P1)   In Q(P1)?\n----  ----------   -----------------------   ------------------------------\nP2    20           10 + 10 = 20              ✗ tie: P2 → PE1 → P1 is the path\nP3    10           20 + 10 = 30              ✓ 10 < 30\nP4    30           20 + 10 = 30              ✗ tie: P4 → P2 → PE1 → P1 is one\nPE2   20           30 + 10 = 40              ✓ 20 < 40   (PE2 → P3 → P1)",
   "originalText": "Y     dist(Y,P1)   dist(Y,PE1) + c(PE1,P1)   In Q(P1)?\n----  ----------   -----------------------   ------------------------------\nP2    20           10 + 10 = 20              ✗ tie: P2 → PE1 → P1 is the path\nP3    10           20 + 10 = 30              ✓ 10 < 30\nP4    30           20 + 10 = 30              ✗ tie: P4 → P2 → PE1 → P1 is one\nPE2   20           30 + 10 = 40              ✓ 20 < 40   (PE2 → P3 → P1)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 473,
   "width": 317,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
