  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 802,
   "width": 247,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 451383,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5969553,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why aim for E, not D",
   "originalText": "Why aim for E, not D",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 486,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 459302,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6074282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Remote LFA always aims for E. Once the packet is at\nE, E’s normal path to every D behind it is fine. So\none Q-space per link serves every destination (RFC\n7490 §5.2.1.3).",
   "originalText": "Remote LFA always aims for E. Once the packet is at\nE, E’s normal path to every D behind it is fine. So\none Q-space per link serves every destination (RFC\n7490 §5.2.1.3).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-59",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 935,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 467221,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6179011,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Node protection (B12) can’t aim for E, so it adds a\ncheck per D.",
   "originalText": "Node protection (B12) can’t aim for E, so it adds a\ncheck per D.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-rectangle-60",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 553,
   "y": 784,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 209,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 475140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6283740,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-61",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 802,
   "width": 247,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 483059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6388469,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "c(S,E) or dist(S,E)?",
   "originalText": "c(S,E) or dist(S,E)?",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-62",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 448,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 490978,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6493198,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFC 7490 writes dist(Y,S) + dist(S,E). We write\nc(S,E).",
   "originalText": "RFC 7490 writes dist(Y,S) + dist(S,E). We write\nc(S,E).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 893,
   "width": 475,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 498897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6597927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "D17: they are equal whenever S–E is a primary link,\nsince then dist(S,E) = c(S,E). c(S,E) is also exactly\nthe avoid-check of B1.",
   "originalText": "D17: they are equal whenever S–E is a primary link,\nsince then dist(S,E) = c(S,E). c(S,E) is also exactly\nthe avoid-check of B1.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-rectangle-64",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 784,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 209,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 506816,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6702656,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-65",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 802,
   "width": 124,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 514735,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6807385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Edge cases",
   "originalText": "Edge cases",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 522654,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6912114,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  S and E are never listed (D17).\n•  Overload (A17): if S is overloaded, the right\n   side is ∞. An overloaded Y stays in Q but is\n   never a tunnel end (B11, RFC 7490 §5.4).\n•  Parallel links (A10): c(S,E) is the protected\n   link’s own metric.",
   "originalText": "•  S and E are never listed (D17).\n•  Overload (A17): if S is overloaded, the right\n   side is ∞. An overloaded Y stays in Q but is\n   never a tunnel end (B11, RFC 7490 §5.4).\n•  Parallel links (A10): c(S,E) is the protected\n   link’s own metric.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-rectangle-67",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1013,
   "width": 1640,
   "height": 117,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 530573,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7016843,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-68",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1031,
   "width": 99,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 538492,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7121572,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-69",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1069,
   "width": 1581,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 546411,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7226301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Q-space is every router whose own shortest path to E avoids the failed link: dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + c(S,E). It is measured towards E, so per-direction metrics need a\nreverse SPF. In Example 4 the wrong direction would wrongly add P4.",
   "originalText": "Q-space is every router whose own shortest path to E avoids the failed link: dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + c(S,E). It is measured towards E, so per-direction metrics need a\nreverse SPF. In Example 4 the wrong direction would wrongly add P4.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b10-text-70",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1144,
   "width": 1631,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 554330,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7331030,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §1.2, §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Q-space)  ·  examples/04-isp-core.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml, 08-node-protection.yaml \n·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "originalText": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §1.2, §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Q-space)  ·  examples/04-isp-core.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml, 08-node-protection.yaml \n·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
